= Parliamentary Motions



- @irian: Criticize the cabinet's handling of the Irian issue.
- @r39: Demand the cabinet revoke Regulation 39.
- @emergency: Condemn the cabinet's frequent use of emergency laws.
- @formateur: Call on the President to appoint *formateurs* for a new cabinet.


@irian
view-if: special_hague_conf == 1
on-arrival: irian_motion_timer += 2

Our members of parliament have tabled a motion urging the government to "continue to demand the immediate incorporation of West Irian into the territory of the Republic of Indonesia".

